# Kanban Boards

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains kanban board files. These are UI surfaces for the Kanban plugin.

## Board Files
Each board is a markdown file with `kanban-plugin: board` frontmatter.

## Common Boards
- `Work.md` - Work-related tasks
- `Personal.md` - Personal tasks
- `gamebus-presenced.md` - Project-specific board

## Rules
- Board files are exempt from the "For future Claude" preamble rule
- Board files carry only `kanban-plugin: board` frontmatter
- Notes ABOUT board items (task notes) follow the full AI-first rules
